id: QUAL-042
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Environment variable used as feature flag
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .py .java .go
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/
patterns:
  - regex: process\.env\.(ENABLE_|DISABLE_|FEATURE_|FF_|TOGGLE_)
    message: "Env var used as feature flag — lacks audit trail, gradual rollout, and kill switches"
  - regex: os\.environ.*\b(ENABLE_|DISABLE_|FEATURE_|FF_|TOGGLE_)
    message: "Env var used as feature flag — use a feature flag service for production control"
fix: Use a feature flag service (LaunchDarkly, Unleash, Flagsmith, or OpenFeature) for production-grade feature control.
